# Nearby Shops — Complete Category Expansion, Shop-Role Dashboards, Commission Engine & Location-Based Discovery

## Problem & Goal

The current LocalSampark `/shops` directory has **13 categories** and a **single generic shop dashboard** ([shop-dashboard/page.js](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Downloads/Local%2001-7-2026/Local%2001-7-2026/localsampark/apps/web/src/app/shop-dashboard/page.js)) that doesn't differentiate between product-based and appointment-based shops. The Appointments and Profile tabs currently show "Under Construction" 🚧. There is no distance-based sorting, no commission tracking for the Super Admin, and no category-specific shop management.

This upgrade will:
1. **Expand** from 13 → **35+ shop categories** covering all essential neighborhood businesses.
2. **Build category-specific Shop Owner Dashboards** for both Product-Based and Appointment-Based models.
3. **Implement a Commission Engine** with Super Admin control, auto-deduction, and transparent payouts.
4. **Add location-based distance** display using the Haversine formula so visitors can see "1.2 km away".
5. **Upgrade the visitor experience** with a full buying/booking flow on both web and mobile.

