## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Business Model Options for Commission:** The plan proposes a **percentage-based commission** model deducted at the time of payment. The Super Admin can set the commission rate per category. An alternative is a **flat-fee-per-transaction** model. Please confirm which you prefer, or if you'd like a hybrid (percentage + flat convenience fee).

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Geolocation Source:** For distance calculation, the plan uses the **Browser Geolocation API** (`navigator.geolocation`) for web and similar native APIs for mobile. This requires the user's explicit permission. If the user denies, shops will be shown without distance sorting. Is this acceptable, or would you prefer an IP-based fallback?

> [!WARNING]
> **Database Migration:** This plan adds 3 new tables and modifies 2 existing tables. The migration should be run **carefully** on the production database. A backup is mandatory before running.

