## Additional Suggestions (Value-Add Features)

Here are bonus features I recommend adding to make this a truly competitive platform:

1. **🔔 Real-time Notifications:** When a new order/appointment comes in, the shop owner gets a push notification + sound alert on their dashboard (via existing Socket.io infrastructure).

2. **📊 Staff Performance Dashboard:** For appointment shops, show which staff member is getting the most bookings, best ratings, and highest revenue.

3. **🏷️ Dynamic Pricing / Surge:** For high-demand time slots (e.g., Saturday evening salon bookings), allow shop owners to set surge pricing.

4. **⭐ "Verified" & "Premium" Badges:** Shops that pay for Premium listing get a gold badge + priority in search results. This is a monetization lever.

5. **📱 QR Code for Walk-ins:** Each shop gets a unique QR code. Walk-in customers can scan it to view the menu/services and place orders directly from their phone while at the shop.

6. **🔁 Repeat Order / Re-book:** For product shops, show a "Reorder" button based on past orders. For appointment shops, show "Book Again with [Staff Name]".

